%20head.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030731/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26","license":null,"text":"\"Building Toward a Dream, Part 1\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Nov 2013. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"uncharted-realms-building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26-e5","era":null,"summary":"Thoros demands justice and asks why Kedarick seeks peace with those who kill his people; the king has no answer.","participants":["thoros-clawkiller","kedarick-vi"],"location":"iretis","importance":"minor","page":"archive/uncharted-realms-building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26","order":397,"story_date":"2013-11-26","storyline":"","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":24,"quote":"\"Justice for Teralos. Justice for the dead. Justice for the living.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030731/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26#:~:text=%22Justice%20for%20Teralos.%20Justice,Justice%20for%20the%20living.","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Building Toward a Dream, Part 1","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2013-11-26","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030731/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26#:~:text=%22Justice%20for%20Teralos.%20Justice,Justice%20for%20the%20living.","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030731/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26","license":null,"text":"\"Building Toward a Dream, Part 1\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Nov 2013. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"uncharted-realms-building-toward-dream-part-1-