26","storyline":"","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":29,"quote":"Udaen was there, interposing his frail body between myself and Thoros, shouting, \"For the King!\"","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030731/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26#:~:text=Udaen%20was%20there%2C%20interposing,shouting%2C%20%22For%20the%20King%21%22","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Building Toward a Dream, Part 1","series":"Uncharted Realms","authors":[],"date":"2013-11-26","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030731/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26#:~:text=Udaen%20was%20there%2C%20interposing,shouting%2C%20%22For%20the%20King%21%22","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030731/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26","license":null,"text":"\"Building Toward a Dream, Part 1\". Uncharted Realms, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Nov 2013. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"uncharted-realms-building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26-e8","era":null,"summary":"Thoros says others told him the king had gone blind in his quest for peace; he seems dazed as if he had not intended the attack.","participants":["thoros-clawkiller","kedarick-vi"],"location":"iretis","importance":"minor","page":"archive/uncharted-realms-building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26","order":397,"story_date":"2013-11-26","storyline":"","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":30,"quote":"They seemed as surprised by the attempt as I had been.","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150920030731/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/uncharted-realms/building-toward-dream-part-1-2013-11-26#:~:text=They%20seemed%20as%2